WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.591 --> 00:00:16.414
Detective Smith scratched his head and said, "You know this pig?"

2
00:00:16.434 --> 00:00:20.857
"I do," Wukong said, banging on the bars.

3
00:00:20.877 --> 00:00:22.578
"Wake up, lazy!"

4
00:00:23.578 --> 00:00:25.340
Bajie popped up and fell off his cot.

5
00:00:27.181 --> 00:00:29.963
"Ouch!" He looked around.

6
00:00:29.983 --> 00:00:31.484
"Who woke me up?"

7
00:00:32.928 --> 00:00:33.869
Wukong laughed.

8
00:00:37.532 --> 00:00:42.256
"Ha-ha, Wukong," Bajie said, pretending to laugh.

9
00:00:42.276 --> 00:00:45.538
"Did you come to this world just to laugh at me?"

10
00:00:45.558 --> 00:00:50.342
"I came here to find you," Wukong said, turning to Detective Smith.

11
00:00:50.362 --> 00:00:52.564
"Why is Bajie in jail?"

12
00:00:52.584 --> 00:00:55.886
"He's a thief," Detective Smith replied.

13
00:00:55.906 --> 00:00:59.469
"I don't believe that," Wukong said.

14
00:00:59.489 --> 00:01:02.732
"He's trying to be good and knows stealing is bad."

15
00:01:03.936 --> 00:01:06.598
"He stole a lot of food," the detective said.

16
00:01:06.618 --> 00:01:09.779
"He ate it and refused to pay for it."

17
00:01:12.061 --> 00:01:12.521
"Oh, okay."

18
00:01:13.121 --> 00:01:13.982
Wukong nodded.

19
00:01:14.002 --> 00:01:16.743
"I believe that, but you can let him out now.

20
00:01:17.083 --> 00:01:18.444
We need to get back to our friends."

21
00:01:20.545 --> 00:01:21.826
Detective Smith shook his head.

22
00:01:21.846 --> 00:01:25.068
"I can't let Bajie leave jail."

23
00:01:25.088 --> 00:01:26.889
"Excuse me?"

24
00:01:27.229 --> 00:01:28.029
Wukong said.

25
00:01:28.049 --> 00:01:30.631
"He broke the law."

26
00:01:31.291 --> 00:01:32.792
Detective Smith folded his arms.

27
00:01:33.640 --> 00:01:34.641
"I can't let him out."

28
00:01:37.503 --> 00:01:42.366
"I wonder where Roxy is," Mara said to Jack and Terrell.

29
00:01:43.167 --> 00:01:45.989
The three friends were at Jack's house, playing games on their phones.

30
00:01:46.009 --> 00:01:49.551
"I hope Roxy is okay," Jack said.

31
00:01:50.832 --> 00:01:52.033
Terrell didn't say anything.

32
00:01:53.114 --> 00:01:56.216
He knew Roxy had left yesterday evening to do Rocket Girl stuff.

33
00:01:57.156 --> 00:01:58.818
But none of them had heard from her since then.

34
00:02:00.699 --> 00:02:02.160
Just then Mara's phone beeped.

35
00:02:04.180 --> 00:02:07.203
"Check out this incredible news alert," she said.

36
00:02:07.223 --> 00:02:12.767
"The pig that Rocket Girl was fighting yesterday just broke out of jail.

37
00:02:13.328 --> 00:02:15.510
A talking monkey helped him!"

38
00:02:15.530 --> 00:02:19.733
"Really?" Terrell leaned over to see the alert.

39
00:02:19.753 --> 00:02:22.555
"Look—there's a video," Jack said.

40
00:02:24.277 --> 00:02:28.220
Mara clicked on the video, and they watched one side of Metro City Jail explode.

41
00:02:30.302 --> 00:02:32.604
Then the pig leaped out, followed by a monkey.

42
00:02:34.476 --> 00:02:36.678
The monkey twirled a bar in the air and did flips.

43
00:02:39.060 --> 00:02:42.142
Together he and the pig leaped onto a cloud and flew away.

44
00:02:43.663 --> 00:02:44.784
Jack's mouth hung open.

45
00:02:44.804 --> 00:02:47.866
"That monkey is so cool!"

46
00:02:52.089 --> 00:02:53.531
Roxy stared at the ugly demon.

47
00:02:53.551 --> 00:02:55.432
"Who are you?"

48
00:02:55.452 --> 00:03:00.436
"I'm the Demon of Black Rain," he replied.

49
00:03:01.972 --> 00:03:06.434
"And I'm honored to have a powerful goddess like you as a guest."

50
00:03:07.815 --> 00:03:08.975
Roxy was confused.

51
00:03:09.795 --> 00:03:11.276
"Why do you think I'm a goddess?"

52
00:03:11.296 --> 00:03:16.418
"You have amazing powers," the demon said.

53
00:03:17.979 --> 00:03:18.739
Roxy nodded.

54
00:03:18.759 --> 00:03:21.581
"That's true, but I'm not a goddess."

55
00:03:23.641 --> 00:03:29.204
"One of my prisoners is the Tang Monk," the demon went on.

56
00:03:30.508 --> 00:03:32.490
"I'm willing to share him with you."

57
00:03:32.510 --> 00:03:35.071
"Who's the Tang Monk?"

58
00:03:35.512 --> 00:03:36.212
Roxy asked.

59
00:03:36.232 --> 00:03:38.754
"And what do you mean by 'share'?"

60
00:03:40.075 --> 00:03:45.358
"He's an important monk," the demon said, a grin spreading across his face.

61
00:03:45.378 --> 00:03:49.241
"Anyone who eats him will live forever!"

62
00:03:49.261 --> 00:03:56.666
"You're evil," Roxy said, "and I'm going to free those prisoners right now!"

63
00:03:57.747 --> 00:03:58.828
She rushed toward a door.

64
00:04:00.536 --> 00:04:01.897
"Don't you dare!"

65
00:04:03.358 --> 00:04:06.200
the demon roared, leaping in front of Roxy to block her path.

66
00:04:09.282 --> 00:04:12.364
Roxy made a fist.

67
00:04:12.645 --> 00:04:17.148
Whoosh! Wind and rain swept through the cave, knocking Roxy off her feet.

68
00:04:17.168 --> 00:04:24.153
"Ahh!" Roxy tumbled through the air and slammed into walls.

69
00:04:25.554 --> 00:04:28.496
The wind carried her out of the cave and into the morning sunlight.

70
00:04:30.956 --> 00:04:32.539
Finally she crashed into a shrub.

71
00:04:34.243 --> 00:04:36.848
Bang! The cave's door slammed shut.
